# Act One

## Scene 1

A kitchen, late at night. A table, two chairs.

MARGARET
(quietly)
You said you'd call.

DANNY (offstage)
Mom? It's me.

She opens the door.

MARGARET
(taking the box from him and setting it
on the table)
Harder than finding your mother's house.

## Scene 2

The back step, later.

INT. KITCHEN - NIGHT

DANNY
Next year I'll call.

